00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:15.659
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:20.107
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:01:20.107 --> 00:01:22.701
Talk to a real person when possible.

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:24.184
Feedback beats guessing alone.

00:01:24.504 --> 00:01:26.802
Hours watched alone is not evidence.

00:01:26.802 --> 00:01:28.717
Neither is a new logo.

